{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-1","storyName":"圣秩","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"第二届万国峰会顺利召开，从卡兹戴尔到阿戈尔，泰拉诸国无不以最高规格前来参会。但在关键时刻，拉特兰城内意外发生了一起爆炸案，刚刚升任枢机的蕾缪安被委派调查此案。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["薇尔丽芙","？？？","帕特里奇昂","蕾缪安","骄傲的小孩","倔强的小孩","骄傲的小孩&倔强的小孩","安多恩","保育员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_39_i14.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"1","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"sticker","id":11,"multi":"true","text":"危机。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":12},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"multi":"true","text":"重复警告。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":14,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n危机。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......危机等级......评估中......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":16,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n不可知......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":17,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n解除锁定。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":18},{"type":"sticker","id":19,"multi":"true","text":"底层运算区域锁定解除。","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":20,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n推演算力已突破上限。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":21,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n拉特兰......爆发。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":22,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":25},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"image","id":30},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":32},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":33,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":35},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"哎呀，终于能喘口气了。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"这辈子都没有说过这么多的话，一想到明天又要再说一辈子的话......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哈哈，要不我们交换一下工作？","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"接待卡兹戴尔使节团的任务交给我，至于明天抵达的那十三座移动修道院，你来负责安置，怎么样？","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"跑来跑去对骨质疏松的老头子来说太不友好了！","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"那倒是不用，帕特里奇昂阁下。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"和我们的萨卡兹友人沟通还顺利吗？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"不赖。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"确实还有萨卡兹无法放下仇恨，比如跟随那位维什戴尔议长的古老魂灵，只是远远瞥见牧首的身影就暴跳如雷。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"好在议长很识时务地把他们训斥得哑口无言，态度好到我都要怀疑关于她的奇妙传闻是怎么来的了。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"卡兹戴尔使节团的主要发言人是那位名叫弗莱蒙特的巫妖，可惜您没看见那场面——","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"整整三小时的外交辩论，从政治到律法，从信仰到生死，他一个人和第一厅、第六厅的十七位枢机激烈地“交换意见”......","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"结束之后，口干舌燥的枢机们围着甜品机海饮番石榴汁。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这样有活力的老家伙，真是令人神往啊！","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"总之，结论是，卡兹戴尔认同了我们的倡议——诸王庭会重新审视传承已久的王权，萨卡兹将在拉特兰的协调下团结一体。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"就在刚刚，我与女皇之声也碰了面——莱塔尼亚的使节团明天清晨就会抵达圣城。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"哦？稀奇事。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"想想两年前，万国峰会应者寥寥，绝大多数人都认为所谓的“拉特兰主张”只是一纸空泛的解经。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"当时，伊维格娜德女皇拒绝了我们的邀请，而这次，她主动请求参加万国峰会。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"甚至已经沉寂许久的赫琳玛特女皇也现身了，这次将一同到访拉特兰......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"莱塔尼亚的诚意很足啊。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"帕特里奇昂阁下，我们是否可以认为，第二届万国峰会已经取得了预期中的成功？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"远超预期，薇尔丽芙枢机。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"目前为止，哥伦比亚、乌萨斯、炎国，甚至是远海的阿戈尔......该来的都来了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"感觉像在做梦。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这只不过是拉特兰长久发展的必然结果。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"启示中的灾异已经临近，萨米冰盖上的黑雪、莱塔尼亚上空的罅隙，甚至冲击海岸的狂潮，都是在呼应它必然的降临。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"灾异当头，任何人都会渴望秩序——拉特兰的秩序。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您说得是。只不过，哪怕做了这么久的准备，这场面也还是让我感到......陌生。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"你尚且如此，其他人就更不必说了。哪怕启蒙时就在布道中无数次听过拉特兰为应对启示中的灾异所铺设的道路......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"真到了亲自迎接它所导向的结果时，也还是会有所犹疑。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您自己呢？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"虽然不想倚老卖老，但到了我这个年纪，哪还有什么犹疑的余地呢？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您准备退休了？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"是啊。我老到连仙人掌挞都嚼不动啦，协助举办这届峰会恐怕就是我能为拉特兰做的最后一件事了。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"阁下，我觉得这是您口味太过奇异的缘故。您说的那种......仙人掌挞，恐怕我也很难咬动。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您不会不知道，冷餐会上的仙人掌挞都是专门为您订制的吧？毕竟拉特兰城没有第二个人痴迷这种怪东西了。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"怎么可能？仙人掌挞是一个甜品鉴赏造诣极高的老朋友倾情推荐的......呃，他叫什么来着......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"算了，言归正传。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"既然还有人心存疑虑，之后将在育婴圣堂举办的那场仪式就至关重要。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我们需要以最有力的方式向所有人展示，拉特兰能带来怎样的可能性。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"明白。我马上交接第七厅的工作，万国峰会接下来的这段时间，我会前往圣堂，确保仪式顺利进行。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"倒也不用那么急。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"哈哈，算了。嘴上有再多抱怨，真行动起来又都是急性子......年轻人还真是相像。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您想起了您的“小菲”吧？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_361_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"根据任务调遣记录——她已经回来了？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_361_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"是啊，明天是我们的家庭聚会......希望小菲喜欢我准备的礼物。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_aircraftalarm","volume":"0.2","loop":"true","channel":"1","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"嗯？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"image","id":134},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_61_g1_nurserytemplesquare.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":136},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":137,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#3$2","duration":"1.5","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"育婴圣堂......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"真是壮美的奇迹。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","switch":"true","offset":"250,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":147},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"char_empty","duration":"1","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"第七厅枢机，蕾缪安。请说。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"蕾缪安枢机，尽快赶往司提望区约维塔街，调查一起潜在的爆炸案。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"帕特里奇昂阁下？我不记得今天的日程包含了这部分内容。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":160},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"你刚刚上任，可能还不太清楚。紧急调度可以无视任何部门的任何安排。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"紧急调度......这是来自哪里的判断？有文件可以参考吗？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":166},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"情况紧急与否从来都是不言自明，无需任何人来做额外的判断。","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"一个来历不明的人屡次携带未登记的爆炸物，在没有公证所监督的情况下出现在公共场合——","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这是对拉特兰秩序莫大的破坏。圣城千百年的宁静，绝不能在万国峰会期间，众目睽睽之下，被一次非法爆炸打破。","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"嫌疑人刚刚被目击在司提望区约维塔街现身，你是目前距离最近的公职人员。","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"请你立刻前往现场。你的辅佐官与公证所的执行者稍后会前去支援，预计将在你抵达现场后的十分钟内到位。","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"明白。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":176},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"......蕾缪安。","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"还有什么情况需要我知悉？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":182},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"本来想祝你上任快乐的......就留到明天聚会上再说吧。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"聚会，您能到吗？大家都知道您临近退休反倒越来越忙，而您又......","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"none","id":188},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"而我又偏偏永远以公务为重？这我倒没法否认。","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"有些老朋友的聚会一拖再拖，拖到我这老糊涂连对方的名字都记不清了，也不好意思再去见面了。","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"但明天的聚会，我会想办法不错过。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","pfrom":"235,0","pto":"235,0","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"您辛苦了。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那么我这就动身去约维塔街。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":198},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":202},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phonebutton_3","volume":"0.5","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"听得到吗？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"none","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"蕾缪安？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我已经在育婴圣堂这边了，但临时有事，就不进去了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"none","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你说什么了吗，我没听清欸。干嘛那么小声，你也不是小气的人吧？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"image","id":222},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（......你误会了，蕾缪安。）","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（我没事。只是现在情况特殊，我得藏起来不被人发现，没法大声说话。）","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那我们直接在菲亚梅塔家的聚会上见吧。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（好。）","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（注意安全。）","id":231},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ringoff_long","volume":"0.5","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呼~","id":235},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"60,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0","block":"false","id":245},{"type":"curtain","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_bg_61_g4_nurseryindoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":251,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩","text":"肯定在这里，虽然他压低了声音，但瞒不过我的耳朵！","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1802_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"不用你说，我也猜到了！","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"窗帘后面没有，柱子后面没有......","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"“这个柜子只有半人高，他那么大的个子肯定没法往里藏”——他一定觉得我们会这么想！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩","text":"笨笨的！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1802_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"他不笨，是我们太聪明了！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩&倔强的小孩","text":"找到你喽，保育员先生！","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"好吧好吧，愿赌服输——今天的自由活动时间延长三十分钟！","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩&倔强的小孩","text":"好耶——！","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩","text":"保育员先生，快带我们玩“光环游戏”！","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1802_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩","text":"今天我要第一个钻进奶瓶，第一个钻出奶嘴，第一个被你抱起来，然后和你手拉手，一起迎接后面钻出来的孩子们！","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1802_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"你们呀，又缠着安多恩叔叔不放了。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"他们想多玩一会儿，没什么不好。吉赛尔，洛米雅，先去启圣大堂做准备吧，这样我一赶到，游戏就可以开始，好吗？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":299},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"前辈，您从来都不会拒绝孩子们吗？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"想必就是这样，孩子们才如此信任您、依赖您......","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您看，几周前他们还对这座陌生的圣堂感到无比恐惧，就连帮他们换件衣服他们都要挣扎到脱力。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"现在他们已经把这里当作自己家了......您功不可没，安多恩前辈。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"我确实没做什么，只是陪在他们身边罢了。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您与牧首真的很像，就连过分谦逊这点也是。其实，有您陪在身边，就能改变许多了。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您与牧首共同带回圣城的那位母亲，不正是因为有您的陪伴，才挺过了最困难的时候？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"我还记得，负责接诊的医生离开手术室后，做的第一件事是去看自己的光环还在不在。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"就连他也不能理解，一位被长枪贯穿了腹部的母亲，是如何带着孩子一起存活下来的。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"简直堪称奇迹。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"等到她顺利分娩再赞叹奇迹也不迟。在此期间，我会尽我所能地继续照顾她。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"......我有些理解牧首对您的看重了，安多恩前辈。由您来负责降生仪式上最重要的接生工作，确实令人安心。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"如果降生仪式一切顺利，育婴圣堂就将全面投入使用，届时，泰拉的每一位新生儿都将接受圣城的庇护与赐福。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"那时，我们才算是真正创造了奇迹，对吧？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"但愿如此......但愿如此。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"好了，我不多打扰前辈了。吉赛尔和洛米雅还等着您呢。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":326},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":328},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":337},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":338,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"司提望区，约维塔街","id":341},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","duration":"1.5","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"真安静啊......","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"头顶光环的队列在街道上延伸，无人驻足，也无人喧闹。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"告解车与甜品车从街边驶过，偶尔有人跨出队列钻进一辆告解车，其他人也只是伸手从甜品车里接过一支甜筒，便继续无声地行进。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"寂静无声，井然有序，圣城拉特兰从来都是如此。","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我已到达指定位置。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"正在秘密排查可疑人员，暂时没有发现任何异常。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","x":"-100","y":"-70","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":360},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"1.5","id":361},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"1.5","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_365_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"1.5","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_365_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"1.5","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$5","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"120,0","posto":"60,0","duration":"2.5","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"60,0","posto":"-90,0","duration":"2.5","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"none","id":372},{"type":"text","text":"隔得很远，一个人影从街角闪过，风撩起她兜帽的一角，露出一抹极其亮眼的红色。","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"2","id":376},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0","fadetime":"1.5","id":377},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0","fadetime":"1.5","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":382},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":383},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.5","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"——！","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":392},{"type":"image","id":393},{"type":"charslot","id":394}],"characters":["薇尔丽芙","？？？","帕特里奇昂","蕾缪安","骄傲的小孩","倔强的小孩","骄傲的小孩&倔强的小孩","安多恩","保育员"]}